{"availability":"available","full":"nady4/calendar-money","name":"calendar-money","description":"🗓️ A personal finance app that turns your income and expenses into a calendar, so you can plan your life.","category":"Finance","language":"TypeScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2024-05-16T03:31:41Z","updated":"2026-08-23T02:59:07Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://money.nady4.com","topics":[],"demo":"https://money.nady4.com/","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T15:38:39.313Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-09T15:38:39.313Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-09T15:38:39.313Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-09T15:38:39.313Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["🗓️ A personal finance app that turns your income and expenses into a calendar, so you can plan your life.","Full-stack cash flow management web application built with React, Vite, TypeScript, Node.js, Express, and MongoDB. Featuring an interactive calendar with drag-and-drop transactions, instant search, AI-powered receipt scanning, advanced Chart.js analytics, category-based budgeting, CSV/PDF backup and restore, adaptive responsive layouts, and a customizable UI."],"features":["Calendar-first financial context — the dashboard opens with a plain-language month summary showing money coming in, money going out, the net for the month, and the next entries on the calendar.","Complete monthly grid — every month renders all of its days, including six-week months, with a clear distinction between the active month, today, selected days, and days outside the month.","Meaningful day cells — each day shows its running total after that day, same-day money in/out activity, category-colored entries, and a visible +N more indicator instead of silently clipping busy days.","Contextual day view — opening a day explains whether entries are recorded or coming up, summarizes money in/out and the running total after the day, then shows the underlying entries.","